s the company has grown from  six to eighteen employees the app  currently has a high rating on the apple  app store  that brings them an additional twenty  thousand users daily and their practical  experience is positive we had a  cooperation with we worked with an old  people's home where the residents were  given a tablet to do our exercises every  day  we adapted them especially for their age  group and made them a little slower  and we got great feedback  attracting 300 000 users also attracted  investors  uli coupe manages a venture capital fund  specialized in digital health products  he doesn't want to divulge the amount he  invested but he says the market has big  potential  in germany we spend eight percent of our  gdp on health  and that's only half of what they spend  in the u.s  the german health market is worth  several hundred billion euros which is  almost double the size of the country's  automobile industry industry  so far the market leaders have all been  us-based but with the current trend for  health startups in germany that could  change
 

